          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "How it works",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "After HTTP 429, honor Retry-After when present and apply exponential backoff with jitter; another client can exhaust the shared bucket before the retry. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/api/api-rate-limit.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:70341db74f56965bc66c27e4fa8a4635208612a36f275a28fbaeb2a9760e5711",
