          ],
          "also": [
            "https://aws.amazon.com/builders-library/timeouts-retries-and-backoff-with-jitter/"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "How-to and procedures",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Use GET /api/atlas/v2/rateLimits with scope filters to inspect applicable policies; atlas api rateLimiting exposes listRateLimits and getRateLimit commands. Defaults can change without notice or differ after support adjustments. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/api/api-rate-limit.md",
          "note": null,
