        },
        {
          "text": "MongoDB’s Terraform provider documents OAuth token acquisition returning 429 independently of resource calls; its troubleshooting guidance scopes this limit to the IP-address and Service Account client combination. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)",
