    {
      "title": "Comparisons and alternatives",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Documented GROUP defaults are capacity 1200 and refill 500/60 seconds for Performance Advisor, including slowQueryLogs, versus capacity 300 and refill 100/60 seconds for Monitoring And Logs. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
